he\ngreeting and exits 0 — the M3 subcommands (`add`, `list`) are added\nalongside it, and any other input reports \"Unknown command\" and exits\nnon-zero.\n\n## M3: Create and read todos (Status: IMPLEMENTED)\n\nThe pure domain model and the YAML-backed store, with `add` and `list`.\n\n**Acceptance Criteria:**\n\n- [x] `Todo` holds an id, a non-empty title and a `done` flag; the title's smart constructor returns `Either[<error>, Todo]` for a blank or whitespace-only title — never throws, never silently trims to empty.","numLines":65,"startLine":40,"totalLines":254}}}
